{"seq":21,"slug":"webassembly-systems","title":"WebAssembly 系统编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# WebAssembly 系统编程\n\n把 WebAssembly 当成「浏览器里跑 C++ 游戏的那个东西」，是 2017 年的认知。到 2026 年，它已经长成一套独立的、跨宿主的系统级执行底座：2025 年 9 月 W3C 正式发布的 Wasm 3.0 带来了垃圾回收、64 位内存、多内存与异常处理；WASI 0.2 让模块能以能力安全的方式触碰文件、网络与时钟；组件模型则把「一个个孤立的 .wasm」缝合成可组合、跨语言的软件单元。这个 hub 要讲的，正是 Wasm 作为系统编程目标时的完整图景——从字节码一直到边缘云。\n\n四章是一条从底向上的实现链，每一层都依赖前一层。\n\n第一章「基础」回答「一个 .wasm 模块到底是什么」。它拆开栈式虚拟机的执行模型、模块的各个段、线性内存与类型系统，以及把源码翻译成字节码的编译工具链。没有这一层，后面所有关于「快」和「安全」的讨论都是空中楼阁。\n\n第二章「运行时与执行」回答「这个模块怎样变成跑起来的机器码，又凭什么能安全地跑」。它对比 Wasmtime、Wasmer、WAMR、WasmEdge 等引擎，剖析 JIT 与 AOT 两条编译路径背后的分层与权衡，最后落到 Wasm 之所以适合做系统底座的根基——沙箱与安全模型。\n\n第三章「WASI 与系统接口」回答「沙箱里的模块如何与外部世界打交道」。纯计算的 Wasm 没有副作用，要读文件、发网络请求就必须有受控的系统接口。这一章讲 WASI 的能力安全设计、把接口抽象成跨语言契约的组件模型，以及模块与宿主之间的绑定与互操作。\n\n第四章「应用」把前三章的能力兑现成真实系统：毫秒级冷启动的服务端与边缘计算、用 Wasm 做安全沙箱的插件与扩展系统、以及让 Rust/C++/Go/Java 等语言殊途同归的多语言生态与移植实践。\n\n读完四章，你会把 Wasm 看成一个可以替代部分容器、可以做安全插件、可以跨语言复用的系统级运行时，而不只是网页里的一段加速代码。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-model","title":"WASM 执行模型与字节码","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/foundations/wasm-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-types","title":"线性内存与类型系统","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/foundations/memory-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compile-targets","title":"编译目标与工具链","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/foundations/compile-targets"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"runtime-execution","title":"运行时与执行","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/runtime-execution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"runtimes-engines","title":"运行时与引擎","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/runtime-execution/runtimes-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"jit-aot-compilation","title":"JIT 与 AOT 编译","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/runtime-execution/jit-aot-compilation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sandboxing-security","title":"沙箱与安全模型","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/runtime-execution/sandboxing-security"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"wasi-system","title":"WASI 与系统接口","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/wasi-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasi-overview","title":"WASI 系统接口","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/wasi-system/wasi-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"component-model","title":"组件模型与接口类型","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/wasi-system/component-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"host-bindings","title":"宿主绑定与互操作","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/wasi-system/host-bindings"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-side-wasm","title":"服务端与边缘 WASM","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/applications/server-side-wasm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plugin-systems","title":"插件与扩展系统","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/applications/plugin-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-ecosystem","title":"多语言生态与移植","url":"/h/languages/webassembly-systems/applications/language-ecosystem"}]}]}